    summary: "This final session reviews the course and sends learners out. Using 1 Corinthians 15:51-58, 1 Peter 1:3-9, Revelation 21:1-5 and 22:20-21, it gathers the main lessons: Christ has conquered death; believers are with him at death and will be raised; God will judge justly; believers are justified by grace; the new creation awaits; and this hope shapes how we grieve, prepare, live and witness. Learners write commitments and are commissioned.",
    scripture: ["1 Corinthians 15:51-58", "1 Peter 1:3-9"], more: ["Revelation 21:1-5", "Revelation 22:20-21", "John 11:25-26"], memory: "1 Corinthians 15:58",
